      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_headbb_11",
      "hash64": "A1489C385BD2311E",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]But I’ve made sure that a dorm room has been\\nall set up for you,\\r\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)],\\r\\nso\\r\\ndon’t\\r\\nforget\\r\\nto\\r\\ngive\\r\\nit\\r\\na\\r\\nvisit\\r\\nlater![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
